    "message": "Akka.NET v1.5.35 and 36 created some DLL hell issues with the Microsoft BCL for Akka.NET plugins that were not dual-targeted to .NET 6 and as a result are not suitable for production use. Please upgrade to Akka.NET v1.5.37.",
